        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "A roof replacement in Utah in 2026 typically costs between $8,500 and $30,000, with most homeowners paying around $14,000 to $18,000 for a standard asphalt shingle roof.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "between $8,500 and $30,000"
        ],
