        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Cost Breakdown by Home Size & Region"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "1,500 sq. ft. Home: $7,000 \u2013 $12,000"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "2,000 sq. ft. Home (Salt Lake City area): ~$14,500 \u2013 $15,400 (averaging about 6% below the national average)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Provo-Orem-Lehi area: ~$14,042 average (range: $5,214 to $22,870)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Larger or complex roofs (2,400+ sq. ft. or multi-story): $20,000 \u2013 $30,000+"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Forum / Community Estimates: Opinions are mixed on local community groups like Facebook Roofing Discussions , where full project quotes span a wide range from $5,000 to over $23,000 depending on hidden damage and tear-off layers.",
